  better graphs/motion, an original logo and screenshot-led documentation.
- 2026-11-11: User made ELI15 a whole-product requirement and explicitly requested
  hover explanations, a pattern button, everyday analogies and a searchable dictionary.
- 2026-11-11: Completed the native redesign, seven lessons, shared dictionary,
  actual-data gallery and regression checks. Issue synchronization and continuity
  finalization are still in progress.
- 2026-11-11: Registered/read back issue #19 and its Project 14 item; recorded
  evidence and persisted owned continuity. Technical completion is ready for
  closed-completed/Done synchronization, not a claim of human acceptance.
- 2026-11-11: Added the user's supplied GIF to README, then reused the exact asset
  in an in-window stock-download screen. The header's Animations switch controls
  both charts and the GIF; completing or failing the request stops it and restores
  the tabs. Verified the installed package without controlling a user's app.
